    skos:editorialNote "Curated classification (group=grp_fossil_fuels_mineral_oils): 'Mineral or Earth Oil' is petroleum (Canadian exports in gallons, incl. Sarnia ON → United States); same commodity as htc:0840/htc:1056. Layer-1 observations: 39 rows, 1875–1881. Series: CSP_Canadian Trade and Navigation ×13; CSP_Canadian_Exports_BlankSeries (inferred, series not printed) ×26. Units: Gallons ×39. Top routes: Quebec → All Countries ×8; Quebec → Newfoundland ×7; Quebec → Labrador ×4; Quebec → United States ×3."@en ;
